WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.750
Install Lagarsoft. Use a LiDAR iPhone or iPad. Open the app and tap +.

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:17.500
Scan one room. Slowly scan walls and openings. Tap Done when the outline is complete.

00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:26.250
Export the DXF. Open the project, then Export. Choose DXF · 2D floorplan and save to Files.

00:00:26.250 --> 00:00:35.000
Return to the website. Upload the DXF, check the room and its measurements. The 2D plan stays editable.
